message.content:
Stop opening new work. Do not merge, push, publish, or change global state.

First produce one concise final digest in chat and write it to:
`/private/tmp/live-spec-night/morning-digest.md`

Include:
- each packet/worktree and commit hash;
- exact changed paths;
- focused test results and any still-red tests;
- what was read-only only;
- merge order and conflicts/dependencies;
- owner decisions genuinely required;
- explicit confirmation that main, the three protected dirty files, M1 and push were untouched.

Then stop and wait. Do not ask me whether to continue with another packet.
